-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Active</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">: true<br> Enables the UI Policy so it is enforced on the Incident form.<br></span></li></ul><ol class="lst-kix_ggyt2d1843dj-0" start="5" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Configure the </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Conditions</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;section as follows:<br></span></li></ol><ul class="lst-kix_ggyt2d1843dj-1 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Field</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">: Impact<br></span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;m