oup </span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">Check mandatory<br></span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Set </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Reverse if false</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;to </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">true</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">.<br> This ensures that when the condition is not met, any field changes applied by the policy are automatically reverted.<br></span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">Review the configuration to ensure accuracy.<br></span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height: